  "limits": [
    "OMO award amount and net change orders are award/accounting fields, not proof of final paid repair cost. Invoice table not yet audited.",
    "Charge schema has no exact violation ID or actual repair completion date. Shared building ID alone does not identify repair-to-defect causality.",
    "Violation schema reports current status/current status date, with certification fields; administrative closure or owner certification does not establish independently inspected physical restoration.",
    "Current snapshots are not complete historical event logs; avoid retrospective as-of leakage.",
    "No individual addresses, unit numbers, names or coordinates acquired as records or used as model features.",
